{"t":"IP","made":"2026-11-06 14:38","name":"International Paper Company","ko":null,"sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Packaging & Containers","employees":62602,"hq":"Memphis, TN, United States","website":"https://www.internationalpaper.com","summary_en":"International Paper Company produces and sells renewable fiber-based packaging in North America, Latin America, Europe, South America, and North Africa. It operates through two segments, Packaging Solutions North America and Packaging Solutions EMEA. The company offers linerboard, medium, whitetop, and saturating kraft; and converts containerboard into corrugated boxes, bulk bins, shipping containers and specialty packaging through its converting facilities. Its products support customers in various industries, such as food and beverage, agriculture, industrial manufacturing, personal care pharmaceuticals and consumer goods. The company was founded in 1898 and is headquartered in Memphis, Tennessee.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"International Paper Company는 북미, 라틴 아메리카, 유럽, 남미 및 북아프리카에서 재생 가능한 섬유 기반 포장재를 생산 및 판매합니다. 이는 Packaging Solutions North America와 Packaging Solutions EMEA라는 두 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 라이너보드, 미디엄, 화이트탑 및 포화 크라프트를 제공합니다. 변환 시설을 통해 컨테이너 보드를 골판지 상자, 벌크 박스, 선적 컨테이너 및 특수 포장으로 변환합니다. 해당 제품은 식품 및 음료, 농업, 산업 제조, 개인 위생 의약품, 소비재 등 다양한 산업 분야의 고객을 지원합니다. 이 회사는 1898년에 설립되었으며 테네시주 멤피스에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":34.24,"mcap":18132473856.0,"pe":null,"fpe":12.60028,"peg":null,"ps":0.74995756,"pb":1.3768699,"ev_ebitda":7.246,"div":5.4,"beta":0.941,"hi52":50.25,"lo52":29.26},"fin":{"rev":24177999872.0,"rev_g":-0.004,"eps_g":null,"gross":0.29775,"op":0.0589,"net":-0.14319,"roe":-0.22296,"fcf":2322374912.0,"cash":815000000.0,"debt":10140000256.0,"de":77.134,"eps":-6.18,"feps":2.7174},"own":{"short":0.1617,"inst":1.0271801,"insider":0.00242},"analyst":{"n":10,"mean":42.3,"median":41.5,"high":51.0,"low":35.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.54545,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":4,"buy":6,"hold":1,"sell